{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17445","headline":"六府诗 · 权德舆","name":"六府诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金罍暎玉俎，宾友纷宴喜。\n木兰泛方塘，桂酒啓皓齿。\n水榭临空迥，酣歌当座起。\n火云散奇峯，瑶瑟韵清徴。\n土梗乃虚论，康庄有逸轨。\n谷成一编书，谈笑佐天子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}